<title>GERMANY: Daimler details 1996 results.</title>
<headline>Daimler details 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Automotive oper profit		 2,942    vs 2,349</p>
<p>    -- of which cars			 3,100    vs NA</p>
<p>    -- of which commercial vehicles    400 loss vs NA</p>
<p>    Aerospace oper profit		  5	  vs 6,724 loss</p>
<p>    Services oper profit		   328	vs 128</p>
<p>    Directly managed bus. oper profit  328 loss vs 1,840 loss</p>
<p>    EPS (U.S. GAAP)			  5.35 dmk vs 11.17 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German industrial group is Daimler-Benz AG. The group announced on March 26 that net income climbed to 2.8 billion marks and that it planned to pay a dividend of 1.10 marks per share. Daimler had also earlier reported that group revenues were 106.34 billion marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
